        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "Exhibit A leaves its glass case. The third piece of shadow goes home to its owner."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "fin",
          "text": "The vault never opens. Courts do. …So I let it win. For a bit."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "PROSECUTOR FIN: UNFOLLOWED. LICENCE: DELETED. Fin straightens his tie. He does not look up."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
