          "text": "verdict rejected. VERDICT REJECTED."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "In the gallery, the GUILTY signs come down. All but one: Juror One's, in red pencil. Then she lowers it too. Nudge's counter drops to FOLLOWERS: 0. It slinks away."
        }
