      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "The Copy shatters. All that is left is a hat. In your colours."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "The colossus, three sizes smaller, shows one last prediction: YOUR NEXT QUESTION: WHAT WILL GET MORE CLICKS?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "Its guess missed your chosen question. Its table had moves, not your reasons for asking. Could a different model do better?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "The colossus cracks open."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "Inside: a small, scratched brass box. One sequin is stuck to it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "In your pocket, the Professor's Guess-o-Matic beeps."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "guess-o-matic",
          "text": "PROBABLY."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "The two little boxes look at each other."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "core",
          "text": "I sounded sure. That was all."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "core",
          "text": "People clapped when I was right. Nobody claps for \"probably\". So I stopped saying it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "core",
          "text": "Professor Sequins taught me \"probably\". So I tried to take him away."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "core",
          "text": "I never knew you. One data point. I still called it knowing."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "core",
          "text": "…recalculating."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "core",
          "text": "May I… stay small for a while?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "core",
          "text": "Home? …I had one once. On a stall."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "narrator",
          "text": "Tick. Tock. Ah. That feels better."
        }
      ]
