      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "At the Pattern Stall, the young Guess-o-Matic gets a painted sign: IT GUESSES."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "sequins",
          "text": "I'd have sold it one day. Old magpies sell things. Not this one. I've labelled it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "The old box sits beside it on the shelf. Two boxes. One sequin."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "Nudge stands by the stall. No clipboard. It is learning a new word."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "A stall-holder shouts: BEST NUTS IN THE WORLD! EVERYONE SAYS SO! Nudge steps up."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "nudge",
          "text": "…Why?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "narrator",
          "text": "Will this one grow up loud? I don't have enough evidence yet. Let's keep watching."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "The sun comes out. The shadow lies where it should."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "Granny holds up the Thinking Trophy."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "granny",
          "text": "\"For the thinker who is always right.\" Is that you?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "avatar-fox-girl",
          "text": "Probably."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "granny",
          "text": "Then it isn't yours. Good. It's very heavy."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "By the stall, Nudge claps. Once. Then the whole Fair claps. For \"probably\"."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "actor": "narrator",
          "text": "Tick. Tock. Good. Say it like that."
        },
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "The end. For now."
        }
      ]
    }
